    <item>
      <title>RAS 標靶打開胰臟癌新局：生華科 CX-5461 卡位下一場「抗藥性管理」戰</title>
      <link>https://drugnewsdrpan-droid.github.io/drugnews-site/articles/2026-06-10-sinphar-cx5461-ras-pancreatic-cancer.html</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://drugnewsdrpan-droid.github.io/drugnews-site/articles/2026-06-10-sinphar-cx5461-ras-pancreatic-cancer.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 10 Jun 2026 02:45:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <category>公司研究</category>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://drugnewsdrpan-droid.github.io/drugnews-site/assets/articles/sinphar-cx5461-ras-pancreatic-cancer/cover-cancer-cell.png" alt="胰臟癌細胞與精準治療示意封面圖"></p><p>Daraxonrasib 打開胰臟癌 RAS 標靶時代後，真正的下一場戰爭是抗藥性管理；生華科 CX-5461 的價值在於能否成為 RAS 標靶後時代的免疫增敏與聯合治療候選策略。</p>]]></description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>生醫公司 IR 不是把簡報變漂亮，而是把管線變成可追蹤的資本市場故事</title>
      <link>https://drugnewsdrpan-droid.github.io/drugnews-site/articles/2026-06-10-biotech-ir-capital-market-story.html</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://drugnewsdrpan-droid.github.io/drugnews-site/articles/2026-06-10-biotech-ir-capital-market-story.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 10 Jun 2026 02:30:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <category>IR 與資本市場</category>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://drugnewsdrpan-droid.github.io/drugnews-site/assets/articles/biotech-ir-capital-market-story/ir-flow.svg" alt="生醫 IR 溝通流程圖"></p><p>好的 IR 內容不是宣傳話術，而是把臨床、CMC、監管、商業化與對標公司轉成投資人可以追蹤的節點。</p>]]></description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>70億美元核藥併購傳聞：Curium想買Lantheus，真正買的是一張核藥時代的入場券</title>
      <link>https://drugnewsdrpan-droid.github.io/drugnews-site/articles/2026-06-09-curium-lantheus-radiopharma-acquisition.html</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://drugnewsdrpan-droid.github.io/drugnews-site/articles/2026-06-09-curium-lantheus-radiopharma-acquisition.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 09 Jun 2026 02:30:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <category>BD / 授權</category>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://drugnewsdrpan-droid.github.io/drugnews-site/assets/articles/curium-lantheus-radiopharma-acquisition/dcard-01.png" alt="Curium 與 Lantheus 核藥併購文章原圖"></p><p>Curium 傳出有意以約 70 億美元收購 Lantheus。這不只是核藥併購傳聞，而是診斷、製造、配送、院端網絡與治療端能力整合的產業訊號。</p>]]></description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>CAR-T 迎接新時代：從血癌走向自體免疫</title>
      <link>https://drugnewsdrpan-droid.github.io/drugnews-site/articles/2026-06-08-cart-autoimmune-new-era.html</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://drugnewsdrpan-droid.github.io/drugnews-site/articles/2026-06-08-cart-autoimmune-new-era.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 08 Jun 2026 02:30:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <category>臨床與 CMC</category>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://drugnewsdrpan-droid.github.io/drugnews-site/assets/articles/cart-autoimmune-new-era/dcard-01.png" alt="CAR-T 自體免疫文章原圖"></p><p>Kyverna 啟動 mivocabtagene autoleucel 的 BLA 滾動式提交，象徵 CAR-T 從血癌治療走向自體免疫疾病的新階段，也重新打開細胞治療的商業想像。</p>]]></description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>沒有 AI 能力的藥廠，將不再被稱作藥廠</title>
      <link>https://drugnewsdrpan-droid.github.io/drugnews-site/articles/2026-06-07-pharma-ai-capability-future.html</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://drugnewsdrpan-droid.github.io/drugnews-site/articles/2026-06-07-pharma-ai-capability-future.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 07 Jun 2026 02:30:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <category>IR 與資本市場</category>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://drugnewsdrpan-droid.github.io/drugnews-site/assets/articles/pharma-ai-capability-future/dcard-01.png" alt="AI 藥廠能力文章原圖"></p><p>AI 正在從工具變成製藥公司的底層能力。未來藥廠不只比管線，也會比資料、模型、實驗自動化與決策速度，沒有 AI 能力的公司將愈來愈難被視為現代藥廠。</p>]]></description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>老靶點都很捲，但不是不能賺錢</title>
      <link>https://drugnewsdrpan-droid.github.io/drugnews-site/articles/2026-06-06-old-targets-differentiation-strategy.html</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://drugnewsdrpan-droid.github.io/drugnews-site/articles/2026-06-06-old-targets-differentiation-strategy.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 02:30:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <category>BD / 授權</category>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://drugnewsdrpan-droid.github.io/drugnews-site/assets/articles/old-targets-differentiation-strategy/dcard-01.webp" alt="老靶點差異化策略文章原圖"></p><p>熱門靶點擁擠不代表沒有價值；真正關鍵是公司能否在身位、差異化、適應症切入、技術換代與 BD 對接中找到自己的獲利位置。</p>]]></description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>從 Ruxolitinib cream 說起：外用 JAK 抑制劑，為什麼不是每個分子都能做？</title>
      <link>https://drugnewsdrpan-droid.github.io/drugnews-site/articles/2026-06-05-topical-jak-inhibitor-skin-delivery.html</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://drugnewsdrpan-droid.github.io/drugnews-site/articles/2026-06-05-topical-jak-inhibitor-skin-delivery.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 05 Jun 2026 02:30:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <category>臨床與 CMC</category>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://drugnewsdrpan-droid.github.io/drugnews-site/assets/articles/topical-jak-inhibitor-skin-delivery/dcard-01.webp" alt="外用 JAK 抑制劑文章原圖"></p><p>外用 JAK 抑制劑的核心不是單純抑制 JAK，而是分子能否穿過皮膚、留在局部、降低全身暴露，並在適應症與製劑設計上建立差異化。</p>]]></description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Retatrutide 殺進減重手術級別：禮來三重受體藥物，把肥胖治療推向新戰場</title>
      <link>https://drugnewsdrpan-droid.github.io/drugnews-site/articles/2026-06-04-retatrutide-obesity-surgery-level-weight-loss.html</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://drugnewsdrpan-droid.github.io/drugnews-site/articles/2026-06-04-retatrutide-obesity-surgery-level-weight-loss.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Thu, 04 Jun 2026 02:30:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <category>公司研究</category>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://drugnewsdrpan-droid.github.io/drugnews-site/assets/articles/retatrutide-obesity-surgery-level-weight-loss/dcard-01.webp" alt="Retatrutide 肥胖治療文章原圖"></p><p>Eli Lilly 的 retatrutide 在三期試驗中把減重幅度推向接近手術級別，代表肥胖治療正從單一路徑抑制食慾，走向多受體代謝調控的新戰場。</p>]]></description>
