    <item>
      <title>40年沒藥的遺傳病迎來重磅進展</title>
      <link>https://drugnewsdrpan-droid.github.io/drugnews-site/articles/2026-06-03-aatd-new-therapy-rna-gene-editing.html</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://drugnewsdrpan-droid.github.io/drugnews-site/articles/2026-06-03-aatd-new-therapy-rna-gene-editing.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 03 Jun 2026 02:30:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <category>臨床與 CMC</category>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://drugnewsdrpan-droid.github.io/drugnews-site/assets/articles/aatd-new-therapy-rna-gene-editing/dcard-01.webp" alt="AATD 遺傳疾病治療文章原圖"></p><p>AATD 治療在近 40 年後迎來新療法競速，Sanofi、Wave、Beam 分別以長效重組蛋白、RNA 編輯與基因鹼基編輯切入，代表罕見遺傳病治療正從補蛋白走向根源修正。</p>]]></description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Biogen 孤注一擲：Alzheimer’s Disease 研發墳場裡，tau 靶點能不能走出新路？</title>
      <link>https://drugnewsdrpan-droid.github.io/drugnews-site/articles/2026-06-02-biogen-alzheimers-tau-biib080-strategy.html</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://drugnewsdrpan-droid.github.io/drugnews-site/articles/2026-06-02-biogen-alzheimers-tau-biib080-strategy.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 02 Jun 2026 02:30:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <category>臨床與 CMC</category>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://drugnewsdrpan-droid.github.io/drugnews-site/assets/articles/biogen-alzheimers-tau-biib080-strategy/dcard-01.webp" alt="Biogen tau 靶點策略文章原圖"></p><p>Biogen 在 BIIB080 / diranersen 的 Phase 2 CELIA 研究未達主要終點後仍推進 Phase 3，反映 AD 研發裡 tau 靶點的高風險、高需求與策略性押注。</p>]]></description>
    </item>
    <item>
